Asset Management, Treasury, CFO Office,

SETTLEMENT CHANNEL CHANGE NOTICE -
ASSET WF-88412 (Havsnas Wind Farm).

Your May settlement (PPA energy plus
curtailment compensation) is due to
run on the month-end cycle. From this
