3. WHY WE ARE WRITING DIRECTLY

  We know settlement-channel emails
  are prime fraud territory - your
  treasury's controls are the
  reason PPA markets work. Checks:
  the settlement preview matches
  your meter data (MDM portal);
  the curtailment window matches
  the TSO log; and your portfolio
  manager can confirm the clearing
  migration on the monthly call.
  The migration applies to all
  non-Nordic generators on the
  May cycle - it is not
  negotiable per asset.

